{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275940/extras/e2f546e49ab1baad6eceb1bba0303316.avif?t=1769194358\" width=612 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275940/extras/384845b9c6ab5b55387bc241f2b800a7.webp?t=1769194358\" width=277 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Scout</strong> procedural lands that shift beneath your feet. <br>\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f <strong>Survive</strong> against the fierce barbarian horde. <br>\ud83c\udf86 <strong>Discover</strong> deep systems and powerful combos. <br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275940/extras/5309f24a0c121489d1cfc2927f694fda.webp?t=1769194358\" width=277 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddea <strong>Mix</strong> over 200 game-changing technologies. <br>\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Improvise</strong> to make the most of each unique run. <br>\u2744\ufe0f <strong>Watch</strong> your choices snowball, creating wildly different civilizations. <br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275940/extras/977526fd110747c9e134ba373fcdb361.webp?t=1769194358\" width=277 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb4 <strong>Draft</strong> your perfect deck of cards to craft a unique strategy. <br>\ud83d\udd28 <strong>Upgrade</strong> your cards, units and cities in every era. <br>\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Build</strong> an enduring empire, from the stone age to the singularity.  <br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\"